# SCOPE 1  |  minima, re-optimised to TightOpt and analysed by FREQ at the Tier 2 level
# State: V-PRC  |  register row: V-PRC-T2-V02
# Why: gives the adsorption-complex binding energy with ZPE (and the 1003 K Gibbs
#      correction) from the same geometry family used for the counterpoise jobs.
# Gate: TERMINATED NORMALLY + converged + 0 imaginary modes.
# Cheap option: replace ' Opt Freq' by ' Freq' in the keyword line to skip the
#      re-optimisation and only take the Hessian at the existing cloud geometry.

! B3LYP D3BJ def2-TZVP RIJCOSX def2/J TightSCF DefGrid3 Opt Freq TightOpt

%pal nprocs 4 end
%maxcore 3000

%scf
  MaxIter 300
end

%freq
  Temp 298.15, 1003.15
end

* xyzfile 0 1 xyz/v-prc.xyz
